* Complete transistor-level TIA: all verified blocks combined in one self-contained deck
* IHP SG13G2 SiGe BiCMOS implementation of the paper-level topology. This file contains circuit content only.
* Flat design hierarchy; X instances are only pinned IHP PDK primitives.
* Active circuitry contains only resistors, capacitors, MOSFETs, and BJTs.
VCC vcc 0 3.3
VMGC mgc 0 1.4
VMC mc 0 0
VOA oa 0 1.2
* Physical resistor-divider references for 1.8 V outputs and 2.55 V follower bases.
RIFBTOP vcc ifbias 700
RIFBBOT ifbias 0 6k
CIFBIAS ifbias 0 1n
RIBTOP vcc ifbase 400
RIBBOT ifbase 0 10.2k
CIFBASE ifbase 0 1n
RIBREF vcc ibn 2.2k
XMIBREF ibn ibn 0 0 sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=5 m=1 rfmode=1

* Balanced input convention used by the earlier verified reconstruction.
IINP 0 inp AC 1
IINN inn 0 AC 1

* Flattened XMODE (MODE_SWITCH_TL)
XM_XMODE_PINV XMODE__mcb mc vcc vcc sg13_hv_pmos w=64u l=0.45u ng=32 m=1 rfmode=1
XM_XMODE_NINV XMODE__mcb mc 0 0 sg13_hv_nmos w=32u l=0.45u ng=16 m=1 rfmode=1
